== cgroup：每个应用一个组，有内存和进程上限，前台的 CPU 权重高；冻结用 cgroup 冻结器，整棵进程树一起停
require-cgroup
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 计算器
cgroup com.phone.calc memory.max 201326592
cgroup com.phone.calc pids.max 128
cgroup com.phone.calc cpu.weight 400
freeze-after 500
key f4
appstate com.phone.calc frozen 3000
cgroup com.phone.calc cgroup.freeze 1
cgroup com.phone.calc cpu.weight 50
appenv com.phone.calc GOMEMLIMIT 144MiB
freeze-after 0
type /
type 计算器
key enter
cgroup com.phone.calc cgroup.freeze 0
key f4

== 内核特性：开机时探测过，主线内核上沙箱和应用生命周期要的都在，没有缺的保护，也没有退而求其次的做法（老内核上缺什么、怎么降级见 24-sku-framework.md §7.5；需 root 和委派的 cgroup，设备上执行）
require-sandbox
require-cgroup
require-own-kernel
kernel missing none
kernel fallback none

== Python 应用：协议与语言无关
