app-log com.example.netcheck netcheck websocket: echoed "hello kario", closed 1000 clean true
fetch-got WS /ws hello kario
key f4
appstop com.example.netcheck
type /
type 网络检查
key enter
at com.example.netcheck/main 10000
fill {fetch}
key enter
wait 4 项检查全部通过 20000
app-log com.example.netcheck netcheck cookies: before keep=1, sent back keep=1; sid=netcheck, without include -
key f4
appstop com.example.netcheck
pkg-uninstall com.example.netcheck
setting developer_mode 0

== 应用自己的长连接：开发商店装的「长连接示例」（keepalive 权限）由系统连上本机回环上的测试服务器、拿到连接；冻结后连接还在，服务器发来消息时它被短暂解冻收下；它的心跳搭推送心跳那次唤醒发出、不另外唤醒，过了期限推送还没来才由系统为它唤醒一次；设置 › 电池记到它名下；最后卸载
