keep-send 重启后
appstate com.example.keepalive running 4000
app-log com.example.keepalive com.example.keepalive: keepalive got: 重启后
keepalive com.example.keepalive data 2
appstate com.example.keepalive frozen 8000
keepalive-due com.example.keepalive
keep-got 1 PING
