#part dev
== 开发者模式：电脑经信任过的数据线（kario device：SSH 到开发镜像的 dropbear，再经 phone-dev 交给 Shell）装应用、看日志、重新载入、重启、卸载；开发者模式关着、数据线没插或没信任时一律拒绝，系统应用不让碰；商店装的 TypeScript 应用装好后在设备上预编译成字节码、从字节码启动，改过的字节码不用、重新编译，卸载时一起删掉
require-usb
require-example karioui-notes
key f4
setting developer_mode 0
at sys.idle
dev !install karioui-notes -> developer mode is off
setting developer_mode 1
dev !install karioui-notes -> no trusted computer
usb-cable on
wait 信任这台电脑吗？ 30000
key enter
dev trust devstore -> trust
dev install karioui-notes -> installed com.example.kariouinotes 1.0
wait 已从电脑安装「KarioUI 便签」
jscache com.example.kariouinotes ready 30000
dev restart com.example.kariouinotes -> restarted com.example.kariouinotes
at com.example.kariouinotes/main 10000
wait 还没有便签
jscache com.example.kariouinotes used
dev logs com.example.kariouinotes
dev !logs com.phone.calc -> is not an installed app
dev !restart com.phone.calc -> is not an installed app
jscache com.example.kariouinotes tamper
dev restart com.example.kariouinotes -> restarted
at com.example.kariouinotes/main 10000
jscache com.example.kariouinotes unused
jscache com.example.kariouinotes ready 30000
dev reload com.example.kariouinotes -> reloading
sleep 2000
revived com.example.kariouinotes
jscache com.example.kariouinotes used
key f4
setting developer_mode 0
dev !uninstall com.example.kariouinotes -> developer mode is off
setting developer_mode 1
dev uninstall com.example.kariouinotes -> uninstalled
jscache com.example.kariouinotes none
key f4
usb-cable off
wait 已停止与电脑共享 10000
dev !install karioui-notes -> no trusted computer
setting developer_mode 0

== 开发者模式：电脑经数据线按键、打字（kario device key、type），状态栏写「电脑在按键」；解锁设备的系统确认和键盘锁不接受电脑的按键（取消可以），要用手机自己的按键
require-usb
key f4
setting developer_mode 1
at sys.idle
usb-cable on
wait 信任这台电脑吗？ 30000
key enter
at sys.idle
dev !key bogus -> not a key
dev type / -> typed 1 characters
dev key esc -> pressed 1 keys
at sys.idle
wait 电脑在按键
setting device_unlocked 1
wait 解锁设备？
dev !key enter -> takes only the keys of the person holding the phone
wait 电脑发来的按键不能回答这个
wait 解锁设备？
dev key esc -> pressed 1 keys
gone 解锁设备？
key f4
at sys.idle
key tab
type *
wait 键盘已锁
dev !key tab -> the lock takes only
dev !type * -> the lock takes only
key tab
type *
wait 键盘已解锁
key f4
usb-cable off
wait 已停止与电脑共享 10000
setting developer_mode 0

== 开发者模式：电脑经数据线推送、拉取文件（kario device push、pull，在 SSH 命令的输入输出里传）：只到开发者目录和开发者模式装的应用的数据里，别处一律拒绝
require-usb
require-example karioui-notes
key f4
setting developer_mode 1
at sys.idle
usb-cable on
wait 信任这台电脑吗？ 30000
key enter
at sys.idle
dev push hello.txt 来自电脑的文件 -> pushed
dev pull hello.txt -> 来自电脑的文件
dev-rm hello.txt
dev !pull hello.txt -> no such file
dev !pull /etc/passwd -> only the developer directory
dev !push ../escape.txt x -> names no file inside
dev !pull com.phone.calc:main.js -> is not an installed app
dev trust devstore -> trust
dev install karioui-notes -> installed com.example.kariouinotes 1.0
jscache com.example.kariouinotes ready 30000
dev push com.example.kariouinotes:fixtures/seed.txt 种子数据 -> pushed
dev pull com.example.kariouinotes:fixtures/seed.txt -> 种子数据
dev uninstall com.example.kariouinotes -> uninstalled
jscache com.example.kariouinotes none
dev !pull com.example.kariouinotes:fixtures/seed.txt -> is not an installed app
key f4
usb-cable off
wait 已停止与电脑共享 10000
setting developer_mode 0

== 开发者模式：电脑经数据线取问题报告（kario device bugreport，私人数据不在里面）、看系统日志（syslog）、旁加载系统更新（update：经 RAUC 验签，模拟的 A/B 手机，没签名的被拒）并重启进去
