dev syslog -u shell -n 20
ota sim
dev !update unsigned -> signature verification failed
dev update signed -> installed 9.0.0 into slot b
dev reboot -> restarting into the system update installed
ota restarts 1 5000
ota off
dev reboot bootloader -> restarting into bootloader
key f4
usb-cable off
wait 已停止与电脑共享 10000
setting developer_mode 0

