dev-debug-send {"id": 3, "cmd": "evaluate", "frame": 0, "expression": "6 * 7"} -> "value":"42"
dev-debug-send {"id": 4, "cmd": "next"}
dev-debug-wait "reason":"step"
dev-debug-send {"id": 5, "cmd": "continue"}
at com.example.kariouinotes/main 20000
wait 还没有便签
dev-debug-end
