dev-debug-send {"id": 1, "cmd": "run"}
dev-debug-send {"id": 2, "cmd": "evaluate", "expression": "6 * 7"} -> "value":"42"
type 调试
dev-debug-send {"id": 3, "cmd": "pause"}
key enter
dev-debug-wait "reason":"pause"
dev-debug-send {"id": 4, "cmd": "stack"} -> "file":"main.js"
dev-debug-send {"id": 5, "cmd": "continue"}
wait 已添加「调试」
wait 1 条便签
dev-debug-end
