appstop com.phone.chat
key f4
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三
app-pid com.phone.chat save
key f4
setting device_unlocked 1
wait 解锁设备？
key enter
wait 设备已解锁
appstop com.phone.wallet
type /
type 飞钱
key enter
wait 设备已解锁，飞钱不在解锁 10000
key f4
setting device_unlocked 0
wait 重新上锁？
key enter
wait 设备已重新上锁
appstop com.phone.wallet
type /
type 飞钱
key enter
wait 设备可信 10000
key f4
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三
app-pid com.phone.chat same
type /
type 张三
key enter
key enter
wait 输入消息
type 换钥之后
key enter
wait 收到：换钥之后 10000
key f4

